{"id":"fi_sicamente","lemma":"físicamente","pos":"adv","rank":3313,"glosses":["physically"],"ipa":"/ˌfisikaˈmente/","order":3316,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-f%C3%ADsicamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estaba cansado mental y físicamente.","en":"I was mentally and physically tired.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505869","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied"},{"g":"mental"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Los hombres son físicamente más fuertes que las mujeres.","en":"Men are physically stronger than women.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"man","l":"hombre"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"strong","l":"fuerte"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"woman","l":"mujer"}]},{"text":"Las mujeres son físicamente más débiles que los hombres.","en":"Women are physically weaker than men.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"woman","l":"mujer"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"weak","l":"débil"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"man","l":"hombre"}]}]}